        "响应不确认源侧记录是否存在。拟目标归属不会授予源侧记录可见权。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "RELOC-04",
      "operation": "patchPlace",
      "given": [
        "馆区 00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000017 正式归属 00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000042，修订为 12。操作者可读取并编辑源侧。",
        "目标不可见。即使能猜出目标 ID，仍按不可见处理。"
      ],
      "request": {
        "path": {
          "id": "00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000017"
        },
        "headers": {
          "x-csrf-token": "fixture-relocation-token"
        },
        "body": {
          "expectedRevision": 12,
          "fields": {
            "areaId": "00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000041"
          }
        }
      },
      "response": {
        "status": 404,
        "body": {
          "code": "RECORD_NOT_FOUND",
          "requestId": "reloc-04"
        }
      },
      "assertions": [
